<section>
  <div class="container">
    <div class="sec-eyebrow"><span class="sec-num">LENS</span> How We Measure</div>
    <h2 class="sec-title">Everything Here Is Local.</h2>
    <p style="font-size:17px; color:var(--wb); max-width:660px; margin-bottom:8px;">You compete for the buyer around South Ogden who wants a truck, Jeep, or side-by-side built right. We measured you against two independent shops that buyer finds on the map.</p>
    <div class="subhead">Who We&rsquo;re Comparing</div>
    <div class="hero-copy-grid">
      <div class="hero-copy-card client">
        <div class="brand-tag">You &middot; The Guide</div>
        <div class="headline">Elevation Garage</div>
        <div class="subline">South Ogden. Consult first, then build.</div>
      </div>
      <div class="hero-copy-card">
        <div class="brand-tag">The Incumbent</div>
        <div class="headline">All Pro Performance</div>
        <div class="subline">West Haven. Open since 2003 and first on the map.</div>
      </div>
      <div class="hero-copy-card">
        <div class="brand-tag">The Catalog</div>
        <div class="headline">Fat Bob&rsquo;s Garage</div>
        <div class="subline">Layton. A parts store with a service bay and the region&rsquo;s biggest audience.</div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section>
  <div class="container">
    <div class="sec-eyebrow"><span class="sec-num">01</span> Your Story</div>
    <h2 class="sec-title">You Sell Like a Guide. Your Website Can Back That Up.</h2>
    <div class="sec-summary"><strong>Your quote form asks better questions than either competitor&rsquo;s entire website.</strong></div>
    <div class="subhead">Homepage Hero Copy</div>
    <div class="hero-copy-grid">
      <div class="hero-copy-card client">
        <div class="brand-tag">Elevation Garage</div>
        <div class="headline">Elevation Garage</div>
        <div class="subline">From Street to Summit. We build rigs that don&rsquo;t quit.</div>
      </div>
      <div class="hero-copy-card">
        <div class="brand-tag">All Pro Performance</div>
        <div class="headline">All Pro Performance</div>
        <div class="subline">Jeep, Truck, SXS Suspension Experts.</div>
      </div>
      <div class="hero-copy-card">
        <div class="brand-tag">Fat Bob&rsquo;s Garage</div>
        <div class="headline">Level Up</div>
        <div class="subline">Bison Offroad Leveling Kits. Shop Leveling Kits.</div>
      </div>
    </div>
    <details class="more">
      <summary>Read more</summary>
      <div class="sec-body">
        <p>Your form asks what the customer drives, what they can spend, and lets them answer &ldquo;not sure yet.&rdquo; That is a shop that guides people.</p>
        <p>Guidance needs proof. The imagery on the site today reads as stock or rendered, not as work you did.</p>
        <p>Show what you built. A before and after of a real job, out on the trail if you have it, does more than any slogan.</p>
        <p>What sets you apart is on the site, but small: veteran owned, 15 years in the industry, and a founder who built his own rigs first.</p>
      </div>
    </details>
  </div>
</section>

